ext","displayName":"Flavor","value":"<em>This spell, like many attributed to Drafna, was actually the work of his wife and former student, Hurkyl.</em>"}]},{"productId":2202,"name":"Hurloon Minotaur","cleanName":"Hurloon Minotaur","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/2202_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":44,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/2202/magic-fifth-edition-hurloon-minotaur","modifiedOn":"2025-03-28T19:04:42.003","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"Rarity","displayName":"Rarity","value":"C"},{"name":"SubType","displayName":"Creature Type or Sub Type","value":"Summon Minotaur"},{"name":"P","displayName":"P","value":"2"},{"name":"T","displayName":"T","value":"3"},{"name":"FlavorText","displayName":"Flavor","value":"<em>The minotaurs of the Hurloon Mountains are known for their love of battle. They are also known for their hymns to the dead, sung for friend and foe alike. These hymns can last for days, filling the mountain valleys with their low, haunting sounds.</em>"}]},{"productId":2203,"name":"Hurricane","cleanName":"Hurricane","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/2203_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":44,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/2203/magic-fifth-edition-hurricane","modifiedOn":"2025-03-28T19:27:58.99","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"Rarity","displayName":"Rarity","value":"U"},{"name":"SubType","displayName":"Creature Type or Sub Type","value":"Sorcery"},{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"Hurricane deals X damage to each creature with flying and each player."},{"name":"FlavorText","displayName":"Flavor","value":"<em>\"The raging winds . . . , settling on the sea, the surges sweep, | Raise liquid mountains, and disclose the deep.\"\r\n<br>\r\n—Virgil,</em> Aeneid, Book I<em>, trans. Dryden</em>"}]},{"productId":2204,"name":"Hydroblast","cleanName":"Hydroblast","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/2204_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":44,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/2204/magic-fifth-edition-hydroblast","modifiedOn":"2025-11-26T15:59:40.37","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"Rarity","displayName":"Rarity","value":"U"},{"name":"SubType","displayName":"Creature Type or Sub Type","value":"Interrupt"},{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"Counter target spell if it is red, or destroy target permanent if it is red. <em>(If this spell targets a permanent, play it as an instant.)</em>"},{"name":"FlavorText","displayName":"Flavor","value":"<em>\"Heed the lessons of our time: the forms of water may move the land itself and hold captive the fires within.\"\r\n<br>\r\n—Gustha Ebbasdotter,\r\n<br>\r\nKjeldoran royal mage</em>"}]},{"productId":2205,"name":"Icatian Phalanx","cleanName":"Icatian Phalanx","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/2205_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":44,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/2205/magic-fifth-edition-icatian-phalanx","modifiedOn":"2025-03-28T19:30:28.58","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"Rarity","displayName":"Rarity","value":"U"},{"name":"SubType","displayName":"Creature Type or Sub Type","value":"Summon Soldiers"},{"name":"P","displayName":"P","value":"2"},{"name":"T","displayName":"T","value":"4"},{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value":"Banding"},{"name":"FlavorText","displayName":"Flavor","value":"<em>Even after the wall was breached in half a dozen places, the phalanxes fought on, standing solidly against the onrushing raiders. Disciplined and dedicated, they held their ranks to the end, even in the face of tremendous losses.</em>"}]},{"productId":2206,"name":"Icatian Scout","cleanName":"Icatian Scout","imageUrl"